Architecture: Elias Holl (1573–1646);  
Golden Hall: concept, wall frescos, ceiling paintings: Johann Matthias Kager (1575–1634);  
Sculptures of the main entrances : Caspar Menneler;  
Imperial busts of the lateral doorways: Christoph Angermeier (c. 1580–1633);  
Artistic carpentry: Wolfgang Ebner (1577–1628)
